#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:9
msgid "Developer experience and provider iteration"
msgstr "开发体验与 provider 迭代"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:11
msgid ""
"This iteration keeps the static factory and shared polymorphic interfaces "
"while reducing unnecessary product and maintenance work. The "
"{download}`75-task execution ledger <developer-experience-execution.csv>` is"
" the task-status authority; its [readable view](../status/ledgers/developer-"
"experience.md) preserves the same fields: W1–W9 contain 63 software work "
"items, I-01–I-06 track integration, and H1–H6 require connected equipment. "
"Implementation, software execution and physical execution are separate "
"columns. A software mechanism does not close a physical exit condition."
msgstr ""
"本轮保留静态 factory 和共享多态接口，减少产品开发与维护中不必要的工作。{download}`75 项执行台账 <developer-"
"experience-execution.csv>` 是任务状态权威；其[可读视图](../status/ledgers/developer-"
"experience.md)保留相同字段：W1–W9 包含63 项软件工作，I-01–I-06 跟踪集成交付，H1–H6 "
"需要连接实物设备。实现、软件执行与实板执行分别记录；软件机制不能关闭物理退出条件。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:20
msgid ""
"The subsequent {download}`N01–N14 delivery-completion ledger <platform-"
"delivery-completion.csv>` and its [readable "
"view](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md) track a separate "
"follow-up scope. They preserve the original 75-task ledger and its fixed P/E"
" evidence. This follow-up closes concrete diagnostics, configuration, "
"consumer-workflow and measurement gaps, then verifies its own final source. "
"Hardware execution and a formal software candidate have separate exits; "
"neither inherits an earlier iteration's status. The existing architecture "
"diagram still applies because these changes refine maintained mechanisms "
"rather than add a new runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"后续的 {download}`N01–N14 交付完善台账 <platform-delivery-"
"completion.csv>`及其[可读视图](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-"
"completion.md)跟踪独立的后续范围，保留原 75 项台账和固定 P/E "
"证据。本轮修复具体的诊断、配置、消费者工作流与测量缺口，然后验证自身最终源码。硬件执行和正式软件候选各有独立退出条件，都不继承此前迭代状态。既有架构图仍适用，因为这些变更完善维护中的机制，没有新增运行时层。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:30
msgid ""
"The {download}`follow-up development index <../delivery/platform-delivery-"
"completion-results.json>` records current observations without relabeling "
"old P/E results. Its pending final-source exits require actual complete "
"gates, fixed examples consumption, offline reproduction and post-merge "
"association; a prepared plan or successful configuration query cannot close "
"them."
msgstr ""
"{download}`后续开发结果索引 <../delivery/platform-delivery-completion-"
"results.json>`记录当前观测，不重标旧 P/E 结果。仍待最终源码证据的退出条件，需要实际完整 "
"gate、固定版本示例消费、离线复现和合并后关联；已准备的计划或成功的配置查询不能关闭这些条件。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:36
msgid "Boundaries that stay explicit"
msgstr "保持明确的边界"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:38
msgid ""
"The current [architecture diagram](../explanation/platform-architecture.md) "
"still applies. One product TOML becomes immutable typed IR and exact static "
"instances; CMake selects sources. Factory getters return existing readonly "
"faces. Products own execution, storage, private PCB and recovery policy "
"outside this repository. A friendlier command does not create a second "
"configuration or build authority."
msgstr ""
"当前[架构图](../explanation/platform-architecture.md)仍然适用。一份产品 TOML 生成不可变 typed "
"IR 和精确静态实例；CMake 选择源码。factory getter 返回已有只读 face。产品在本仓库之外拥有执行、存储、私有 PCB "
"与恢复策略。更易用的命令不建立第二份配置或构建权威。"

