#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:0
msgid "W2: configuration"
msgstr "W2：配置"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:0
msgid ""
"Board-first bindings, validated profiles, human explanation, effective diff "
