msgstr "从 Board 查询绑定、经验证的 profile、人读解释、有效差异和编辑器 schema"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/developer-experience.md:0
msgid "Normal rejection and immutable resolved output remain authoritative"
